>> title: French Onion Soup
>> category: Soups
>> tags: onion, cheese, broiler, french
>> counters: Diner
>> aka: soupe à l'oignon, onion soup gratinée, onion soup au gratin, French onion
>> servings: 6
>> time: 2 hr

>> step: caramelize 50 min
Caramelize @yellow onions{3%lb}(1.4 kg; thinly sliced) in @unsalted butter{3%Tbs} with @kosher salt{1%tsp} in a #Dutch oven{} for ~{50%min}.

Deglaze @&(~1)onions{} with @dry sherry{1/2%cup}(120 mL).

>> step: simmer 30 min
Simmer @&(~1)onions{} for ~{30%min} with @beef stock{6%cups}(1.4 L), @thyme{4%sprigs}, and @bay leaf{1}.

>> step: toast dry
Toast @baguette slices{6}(1 in thick, day-old) until dry.

>> step: broil 3 min
Ladle @&(~2)soup{} into #oven-safe bowls{}, float @&(~1)toasts{} on top, cover with @Gruyère{8%oz}(225 g; grated), and broil until browned and bubbling, ~{3%min}.
